---
title: Writing Graph
---
stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  plan_outline
  write_draft
  review_draft
  state decision <<choice>>
  finalize
  revise_draft
  state finalize_broadcast_fork <<fork>>

  [*] --> plan_outline
  plan_outline --> write_draft
  write_draft --> review_draft
  review_draft --> decision
  decision --> finalize: approved
  decision --> revise_draft: needs revision
  revise_draft --> write_draft
  finalize --> finalize_broadcast_fork
  finalize_broadcast_fork --> [*]
  finalize_broadcast_fork --> [*]
